<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>In the calm of the noontide, in sorrow’s lone hour,</l><l>In times when temptation casts o’er me its power;</l><l>In the tempests of life, on its wide, heaving sea,</l><l>Thou blest Rock of Ages, I’m hiding in Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>How oft in the conflict, when pressed by the foe,</l><l>I have fled to my Refuge and breathed out my woe,,</l><l>How often, when trials like sea-billows roll,</l><l>Have I hidden in Thee, O Thou Rock of my soul.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
